e":"single_visit_or_unspecified","drawingEvidence":{"axisDrawingIds":[72,74],"marks":[{"drawingIndex":70,"bboxPt":[286.689,388.59698,326.689,529.78699],"colour":"#1976d2","fill":"#1976d2","stroke":"#000000","lineWidthPt":1.0}],"curves":[]}}]},{"pageId":"d8420cc7828ed_p2","documentSha256":"8420cc7828eda8f8be08f275e9d53d10544fe3906732786275d35ac59042c842","pageNumber":2,"text":[{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[66.3844,116.31287,135.73239,128.31287],"origin":[66.3844,125.58502],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[147.73239,116.56485,217.41737,127.56485],"origin":[147.73239,125.06433],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Interpretation","bbox":[34.3465,144.03752,124.57652,158.03752],"origin":[34.3465,154.85504],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The Short Mood and Feelings Questionnaire (MFQ-self) was administered on 3 September","bbox":[91.0394,163.29306,533.04144,174.29306],"origin":[91.0394,171.79254],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2025.","bbox":[91.0394,175.39304,118.56139,186.39304],"origin":[91.0394,183.89252],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The client obtained a total score of 16 out of a possible 26. This indicates substantial depressive","bbox":[91.0394,199.59305,558.16559,210.59305],"origin":[91.0394,208.09253],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"symptoms. Young people scoring in this range typically experience pervasive and persistent","bbox":[91.0394,211.69302,537.94733,222.69302],"origin":[91.0394,220.1925],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"symptoms across multiple domains, including marked low mood, pronounced negative self-","bbox":[91.0394,223.793,534.25134,234.793],"origin":[91.0394,232.29248],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"evaluation, anhedonia, and notable changes in sleep, appetite, or concentration. The severity","bbox":[91.0394,235.89297,544.12946,246.89297],"origin":[91.0394,244.39246],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"and combination of symptoms at this level are likely causing impairment in social, academic, or","bbox":[91.0394,247.99295,551.97235,258.99295],"origin":[91.0394,256.49243],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"family functioning.","bbox":[91.0394,260.09293,179.07239,271.09293],"origin":[91.0394,268.59241],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Items with the highest ratings were:","bbox":[91.0394,284.29294,263.44235,295.29294],"origin":[91.0394,292.79242],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 1. I felt miserable or unhappy. (True)","bbox":[91.0394,296.39291,275.66333,307.39291],"origin":[91.0394,304.8924],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 2. I didn’t enjoy anything at all. (True)","bbox":[91.0394,308.49289,278.73233,319.49289],"origin":[91.0394,316.99237],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 3. I felt so tired I just sat around and did nothing. (True)","bbox":[91.0394,320.59286,365.56635,331.59286],"origin":[91.0394,329.09235],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 5. I felt I was no good anymore. (True)","bbox":[91.0394,332.69287,284.23233,343.69287],"origin":[91.0394,341.19235],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- 8. I hated myself. (True)","bbox":[91.0394,344.79288,214.52534,355.79288],"origin":[91.0394,353.29236],"font":"Helvetica-Oblique","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[34.3464,384.32324,290.26636,398.32324],"origin":[34.3464,395.14075],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Each of the 13 MFQ-Self items are scored 0 (not true), 1 (sometimes), or 2 (true), reflecting the","bbox":[91.0393,403.57828,552.59943,414.57828],"origin":[91.0393,412.07776],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"frequency of depressive symptoms experienced over the past 2 weeks. The sum of responses","bbox":[91.0393,415.67828,548.9585,426.67828],"origin":[91.0393,424.17776],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to all items produces a total score ranging from 0 to 26. Higher scores indicate greater severity","bbox":[91.0393,427.77829,550.16833,438.77829],"origin":[91.0393,436.27777],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"of depressive symptoms.","bbox":[91.0393,439.8783,212.68826,450.8783],"origin":[91.0393,448.37778],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Based on empirical research and established cut-off values, scores can be interpreted using","bbox":[91.0393,464.07831,538.5744,475.07831],"origin":[91.0393,472.57779],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"three severity categories.","bbox":[91.0393,476.17831,213.92026,487.17831],"origin":[91.0393,484.6778],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Minimal: 0-7: Total scores below 8 fall within the range typically observed in community samples","bbox":[91.0393,488.27832,558.07733,499.27832],"origin":[91.0393,496.7778],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"and indicate minimal to no clinically significant depression.","bbox":[91.0393,500.37833,374.69623,511.37833],"origin":[91.0393,508.87781],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Elevated: 8-11: Total scores of 8 to 11 indicate the presence of clinically significant depressive","bbox":[91.0393,524.57837,548.9693,535.57837],"origin":[91.0393,533.07782],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"symptoms that sit at the 75th percentile compared to a community sample, and the 25th","bbox":[91.0393,536.67841,517.79529,547.67841],"origin":[91.0393,545.17786],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"percentile of a clinical sample.","bbox":[91.0393,548.77838,237.75726,559.77838],"origin":[91.0393,557.27783],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Severe: 12+: Total scores of 12 and above represent a higher severity category at approximately","bbox":[91.0393,572.97839,560.90442,583.97839],"origin":[91.0393,581.47784],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"the 95th percentile in community samples and the 50th percentile in clinical samples. This","bbox":[91.0393,585.07843,526.93628,596.07843],"origin":[91.0393,593.57788],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"severity category comes from a threshold identified by Thabrew et al. (2018) in adolescent","bbox":[91.0393,597.17841,529.38928,608.17841],"origin":[91.0393,605.67786],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"samples (ranging 11-19 years old), optimally distinguished young people meeting diagnostic","bbox":[91.0393,609.27838,538.56323,620.27838],"origin":[91.0393,617.77783],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"criteria for a depressive disorder from those with subthreshold symptoms.","bbox":[91.0393,621.37842,448.04428,632.37842],"origin":[91.0393,629.87787],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The MFQ-Self can be used for monitoring symptom changes over time during treatment.","bbox":[91.0393,645.57843,520.20422,656.57843],"origin":[91.0393,654.07788],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Research examining meaningful score changes suggests a 2-point change in either direction","bbox":[91.0393,657.67841,541.63239,668.67841],"origin":[91.0393,666.17786],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"represents a noticeable shift in symptom severity.","bbox":[91.0393,669.77844,331.90628,680.77844],"origin":[91.0393,678.27789],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"On first administration, a bar graph displaying the total raw score is presented. A comparison","bbox":[91.0393,693.97845,541.61041,704.97845],"origin":[91.0393,702.47791],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"graph is also displayed showing the client's score relative to community data from Schlechter et","bbox":[91.0393,706.07843,554.71136,717.07843],"origin":[91.0393,714.57788],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"al. (2023) and clinical data from Thabrew et al. (2018). When the assessment is administered","bbox":[91.0393,718.17841,544.05237,729.17841],"origin":[91.0393,726.67786],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"multiple times, a longitudinal line graph is generated to track changes in the total raw score over","bbox":[91.0393,730.27844,556.9115,741.27844],"origin":[91.0393,738.77789],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"time.","bbox":[91.0393,742.37842,114.8763,753.37842],"origin":[91.0393,750.87787],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 2 of 3","bbox":[510.2363,809.92645,561.38641,819.92645],"origin":[510.2363,817.65326],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[]},{"pageId":"d8420cc7828ed_p3","documentSha256":"8420cc7828eda8f8be08f275e9d53d10544fe3906732786275d35ac59042c842","pageNumber":3,"text":[{"text":"Client Name","bbox":[66.3844,116.31287,135.73239,128.31287],"origin":[66.3844,125.58502],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":12.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Generic Client","bbox":[147.73239,116.56485,217.41737,127.56485],"origin":[147.73239,125.06433],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Client Responses","bbox":[34.3465,164.44048,151.82051,178.44048],"origin":[34.3465,175.258],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Not True","bbox":[291.02664,192.58359,324.09171,201.08359],"origin":[291.02664,199.15137],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Sometimes","bbox":[385.51773,192.58359,428.02628,201.08359],"origin":[385.51773,199.15137],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"True","bbox":[497.24628,192.58359,514.72229,201.08359],"origin":[497.24628,199.15137],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[37.32189,220.93008,42.04789,229.43008],"origin":[37.32189,227.49786],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"I felt miserable or unhappy.","bbox":[57.02345,220.93008,159.54193,229.43008],"origin":[57.02345,227.49786],"font":"Helvetica","size":8.5,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0","bbox":[304.7789,220.44061,310.3389,230.44063],"origin":[304.7789,228.16742],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[403.99179,220.44061,409.55179,230.44063],"origin":[403.99179,228.16742],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2","bbox":[503.20401,220.44